Unstake_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when amount zero
│  └── it should revert
└── when amount not zero
   ├── when caller never staked
   │  └── it should revert
   ├── when amount exceeds staked balance
   │  └── it should revert
   └── when amount within staked balance
      ├── given caller is the last staker
      │  └── it should return the full amount without a fee
      │     ├── it should clear the staker balance
      │     ├── it should not open a payout round
      │     └── it should emit {Unstaked} event
      └── given other stakers remain
         ├── given paused
         │  └── it should still pay out the stake
         ├── given unstaking fee zero
         │  └── it should return the full amount plus the pending reward
         ├── given fee rounds down to zero
         │  └── it should return the full amount plus the pending reward
         └── given fee not zero
            ├── given staker has no pending reward
            │  └── it should charge the fee and spread it over the remaining stakes
            │     ├── it should transfer the amount minus the fee
            │     ├── it should reduce the stake and the total stakes by the full amount
            │     ├── it should open a payout round with the fee
            │     └── it should emit {Payout} and {Unstaked} events
            └── given staker has pending reward
               └── it should add the pending reward to the transfer
                  ├── it should transfer the amount minus the fee plus the reward
                  └── it should emit {Payout}, {ClaimReward} and {Unstaked} events
